{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full","toc":false},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div style=\"max-width:800px; margin:40px auto; padding:0 20px;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:24px; align-items:flex-start;\">\n<img src=\"profile.jpg\" style=\"width:200px; height:200px; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 20%; border:4px solid #1a2744; flex-shrink:0; display:block;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:600; color:#1a2744; margin-bottom:6px;\">Tuhinur Rahman Chowdhury</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#555; margin-bottom:4px;\">PhD Student | Agricultural & Applied Economics</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#555; margin-bottom:16px;\">Texas Tech University</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#444; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:16px;\">I am a PhD student in the Department of Agricultural and Applied Economics at Texas Tech University. My research focuses on applied econometrics, policy analysis, agricultural labor markets, and rural economic issues, with a focus on using quantitative methods to address real-world challenges. I am especially interested in causal inference, labor economics, and time series analysis.</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<a href=\"mailto:tuhchowd@ttu.edu\" style=\"font-size:0.82rem; color:#1a2744; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #1a2744; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Email</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tuhinchy\" style=\"font-size:0.82rem; color:#1a2744; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #1a2744; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">LinkedIn</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/tuhinchy\" style=\"font-size:0.82rem; color:#1a2744; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #1a2744; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">GitHub</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:2px solid #1a2744; padding-top:16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem; font-weight:600; color:#1a2744; margin-bottom:12px;\">Research Interests</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<span style=\"background:#1a2744; color:white; font-size:0.8rem; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Applied Econometrics</span>\n<span style=\"background:#1a2744; color:white; font-size:0.8rem; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Policy Analysis</span>\n<span style=\"background:#1a2744; color:white; font-size:0.8rem; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Agricultural Labor Markets</span>\n<span style=\"background:#1a2744; color:white; font-size:0.8rem; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Causal Inference</span>\n<span style=\"background:#1a2744; color:white; font-size:0.8rem; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:4px;\">Time Series Analysis</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:2px solid #1a2744; padding-top:16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1rem; font-weight:600; color:#1a2744; margin-bottom:12px;\">Education</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#444; line-height:1.8;\">\n<div><strong>Texas Tech University</strong> — PhD in Agricultural & Applied Economics (Expected 2027)</div>\n<div><strong>Virginia Tech University</strong> — MS in Agricultural & Applied Economics (2024)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div style=\"max-width:800px; margin:40px auto; padding:0 20px;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:24px; align-items:flex-start;\">\n<img src=\"profile.jpg\" style=\"width:200px; height:200px; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 20%; border:4px solid #1a2744; flex-shrink:0; display:block;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:600; color:#1a2744; margin-bottom:6px;\">Tuhinur Rahman Chowdhury</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#555; margin-bottom:4px;\">PhD Student | Agricultural & Applied Economics</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#555; margin-bottom:16px;\">Texas Tech University</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#444; line